  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut the sweet potato into fries. Cut the zucchini into thick sticks. Place the sweet potato on a lined oven tray and the zucchini on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle both trays with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4e05a41964b9c0339ff/step-9f06b000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggie fries are baking, trim the ends of the green beans. Slice the lemon into wedges. When the fries have 10 minutes cook time remaining, add the green beans to the zucchini tray, tossing to coat. Return to the oven until tender, 10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4e05a41964b9c0339ff/step-18c54610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chick'n until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Add grated Parmesan cheese and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4e05a41964b9c0339ff/step-c89a9c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the cheesy Parmesan plant-based crumbed chicken, sweet potato and zucchini fries and green beans between plates. Serve with the lemon wedges and garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4e05a41964b9c0339ff/step-2dcbac30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
